/* The diner manager (STAGE1_PROPOSAL.md 7.3, venue: the diner). Not a villain: in Stage 1 he is counting, not leering,
   and slowly losing control of his own diner. Starts hidden and shows up once she works shifts there.
   Gates: The Debrief comes before The Diner Incident (main_dinerIncident waits for it), the Sales Report after it.
